<h2 style="color: #0F3725; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800;">Your Order is Being Prepared! 🧑‍🍳</h2>
<p>Dear <strong><%= customerName %></strong>,</p>
<p>Great news! The restaurant has accepted your order <strong>#<%= orderId.toString().slice(-6).toUpperCase() %></strong> and is currently preparing your meal.</p>

<div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0F3725; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-bottom: 8px;">Estimated Prep Time</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #16A34A; margin: 8px 0;">
    ⏱️ <%= typeof estimatedPrepTime !== 'undefined' ? estimatedPrepTime : 20 %> minutes
  </p>
</div>

<p style="color: #4B5563; margin-top: 24px;">We'll send you another update as soon as your order is ready for pickup or delivery!</p>
